<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge"/>
<title>Possible duplicate organization: {!IndividualApplication.Name}</title>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;width:100%!important;}
  body{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;}
  table{border-collapse:collapse!important;}
  img{border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;}
  a{color:#BF2026;}
  @media only screen and (max-width:620px){
    .container{width:100%!important;max-width:100%!important;}
    .btn{width:100%!important;}
    .btn a{display:block!important;}
  }
</style>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F4F4F5;">
<center style="width:100%;background-color:#F4F4F5;">

<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;
max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">
{!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c} -
This application may match an organization already on record.
</div>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
bgcolor="#F4F4F5">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">

<table class="container" width="100%" cellpadding="0"
cellspacing="0" border="0"
style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;
border:1px solid #E6E6E6;border-radius:8px;">

<!-- Header: -->
<tr>
  <td bgcolor="#BF2026"
      style="padding:15px 32px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
      <tr>
        <td align="left" valign="middle"
            style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;
            font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;
            text-transform:uppercase;color:#F9C9A8;">
          Possible duplicate

          <div style="margin-top:8px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
          font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:normal;
          text-transform:none;line-height:1.5;color:#ffffff;">
            Application {!IndividualApplication.Name} -
            {!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c}
          </div>
        </td>

        <td align="right" valign="middle" width="110">
          <img
            src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020UmX&amp;oid=00DF6000000APXN&amp;lastMod=1782557340000"
            width="110"
            alt="Wadhwani Grants"
            style="display:block;border:0;width:110px;height:auto;"/>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>

<!-- Keep the existing orange divider unchanged -->
<tr>
  <td bgcolor="#F2672A" height="4"
      style="height:4px;background:#F2672A;"></td>
</tr>

<!-- Heading -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:22px 32px 0;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;
color:#414042;">
This organization may already be on record
</h1>
</td>
</tr>

<!-- Email body -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 32px 10px;">

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Hi {!IndividualApplication.WG_Validator_Name__c},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
A new application from
<strong>{!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c}</strong>
looks like a match for an organization already on our records.
Nothing moves ahead until you settle whether the two are the same.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
<strong>The possible match:</strong>
</p>

<!-- Possible match panel -->
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
style="background:#F7F2F2;border-left:3px solid #F2672A;
border-radius:3px;margin:4px 0 18px;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:16px 20px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.8;color:#414042;">

<strong>New application:</strong>
{!IndividualApplication.Organization_Name__c}
({!IndividualApplication.Name})
<br/>

<strong>Existing organization:</strong>
{!IndividualApplication.Duplicate_Org_Matched_Name__c}

</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Open the match and compare the two organizations on registration
number, address, and contact person.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
If they are the same organization, link the new application to
the existing record so both sit under one organization.
If they are different, mark the match as not a duplicate.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">
Either way, the application then goes to the completeness check.
Please decide by <strong>[Insert Due Date Merge Field]</strong>.
</p>

<!-- Review button -->
<table class="btn" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
style="margin:10px 0 20px;">
<tr>
<td align="center" bgcolor="#BF2026"
style="border-radius:4px;">
<a href="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.site.com/wcf/s/validator-dashboard"
target="_blank"
style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;
font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">
Review the possible match
</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:18px 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
font-size:15px;color:#414042;">
Wadhwani Grants Platform
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- Footer -->
<tr>
  <td style="padding:20px 32px 24px;
      font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;
      color:#6D6E71;line-height:1.55;">

    <img
      src="https://wadhwanifoundation--wgsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015e10000020VVh&amp;oid=00DF6000000APXN&amp;lastMod=1782560396000"
      width="132"
      alt="Wadhwani Grants"
      style="display:block;width:132px;height:auto;margin:0 0 12px;"/>

    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
       font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
      Wadhwani Grants, the grant-making arm of the Wadhwani Foundation.
    </p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
       font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
      An automated notice from the Wadhwani Grants Platform.
      The applicant is not copied on this email, and replies to this
      address are not read.
    </p>

    <p style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
       font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">
      © {!YEAR(TODAY())} Wadhwani Charitable Foundation. All rights reserved.
    </p>

  </td>
</tr>


</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</center>
</body>
</html>